 "starter": "# palindrome -- practice exercise (RISC-VISTA)\n# Return 1 if the zero-terminated string at a0 is a palindrome, else 0.\n# Hint: find the end first (lbu until 0), then compare from both ends.\n        .data\ntext:   .space 64               # the tests put their strings here\n        .text\npalindrome:\n        # a0 = address of the string\n        li   a0, 0              # replace with your code\n        ret\n",
 "entry": "palindrome",
